1
00:00:00,544 --> 00:00:03,309
Kartu SIM sekarang bisa dipasang tanpa

2
00:00:03,329 --> 00:00:04,700
pernah membuka baki SIM.

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:08,556
Itulah eSIM.

4
00:00:08,696 --> 00:00:11,482
Chipnya sudah disolder di dalam ponsel

5
00:00:11,502 --> 00:00:13,796
sejak pabrik, tapi awalnya kosong,

6
00:00:13,816 --> 00:00:14,775
belum berisi nomor.

7
00:00:15,214 --> 00:00:17,532
Saat kamu membeli eSIM,

8
00:00:17,598 --> 00:00:21,074
operator menyiapkan profil nomormu di server.

9
00:00:21,214 --> 00:00:24,531
QR code yang kamu pindai tidak berisi

10
00:00:24,551 --> 00:00:27,402
nomor, hanya alamat server dan kode pesanan.

11
00:00:27,542 --> 00:00:30,076
Ponsel lalu menjemput profil itu sendiri.

12
00:00:30,216 --> 00:00:33,852
Chip dan server saling memeriksa sertifikat,

13
00:00:33,913 --> 00:00:37,829
dan profil dikirim terenkripsi sampai

14
00:00:37,849 --> 00:00:38,799
masuk ke chip.

15
00:00:38,947 --> 00:00:41,598
Satu chip bisa menyimpan beberapa profil

16
00:00:41,618 --> 00:00:43,924
operator, tapi hanya satu atau dua

17
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:45,160
yang aktif bersamaan.

18
00:00:45,599 --> 00:00:47,624
Di Indonesia, pindah ke eSIM masih

19
00:00:47,644 --> 00:00:49,004
imbauan, belum wajib.

20
00:00:49,144 --> 00:00:50,773
Sejak Juli dua ribu dua puluh enam,

21
00:00:50,793 --> 00:00:52,675
pelanggan baru mendaftar dengan pindai wajah.

22
00:00:52,815 --> 00:00:55,658
Dan tidak semua ponsel mendukung eSIM.

23
00:00:56,097 --> 00:00:57,380
Jadi kartunya hilang,

24
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,221
tapi nomormu tetap ada.

25
00:00:59,386 --> 00:01:00,965
Ini AUDIRA Explained.
